  StartingNode:
    Speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d22b009a9dc50a2679df5e6754db9d3, type: 2}
    DialogueText: "Ah, my problem-solver. All quiet at the yard now, I trust. The
      council thanks you, in its way — and so do I. Keep your head down and
      yours is safe with me. I daresay I'll have need of you again before long."
